Connect GamiPress with SliceWP

== Description ==

Gamify your [SliceWP](https://wordpress.org/plugins/slicewp/ "SliceWP") site thanks to the powerful gamification plugin, [GamiPress](https://wordpress.org/plugins/gamipress/ "GamiPress")!

This plugin automatically connects GamiPress with SliceWP adding new activity events.

= New Events =

* Affiliate sign up: When an user becomes an affiliate.
* Earn a commission: When an affiliate earns a new commission.
* Get a commission paid: When an affiliate gets a commission marked as paid.
* Get a commission rejected: When an affiliate gets a commission rejected.

== Installation ==

= From WordPress backend =

1. Navigate to Plugins -> Add new.
2. Click the button "Upload Plugin" next to "Add plugins" title.
3. Upload the downloaded zip file and activate it.

= Direct upload =

1. Upload the downloaded zip file into your `wp-content/plugins/` folder.
2. Unzip the uploaded zip file.
3. Navigate to Plugins menu on your WordPress admin area.
4. Activate this plugin.

